WEBVTT

00:00:57.386 --> 00:01:00.473
So today I want to take you to a journey

00:01:00.515 --> 00:01:03.184
to explore and understand
the origin of life,

00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:07.939
the future and where it is headed

00:01:07.939 --> 00:01:12.193
and an ethical dilemma
that may arise from understanding this.

00:01:12.193 --> 00:01:17.532
First things first, Earth was formed
4.5 billion years ago.

00:01:17.532 --> 00:01:19.867
Life happened fairly quickly,

00:01:19.867 --> 00:01:22.620
within the first
few hundred million years.

00:01:22.662 --> 00:01:24.831
So that's very fast.

00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:28.417
Think about that next time
you feel like you're aging too fast.

00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:29.460
(Laughter)

00:01:29.502 --> 00:01:31.420
You're not. You're fine.